{"version":1,"content":"<p>AI 對電力永無止境的巨大需求，已經成為我們 AI 指數報告中最值得關注的信號之一。這一主題在 2021 年末就開始出現在我們的報道中，並在 2024 年第三季度熱度飆升 —— 遠早於美國各大電網運營商開始上報電網容量付款激增的現象。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587832.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:23:59.622576+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:07:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:14.419575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:14.419575+00:00","content_hash":"a48aa7593242816bf6063482a27532c41979d9ad9e25961e434ff58b303e2586","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}